  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>When using <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/CLICK_ACTION_SIT" target="_blank">CLICK_ACTION_SIT</a>, an avatar who clicks the object and sits down and then clicks the object again will fire a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Touch" target="_blank">touch</a> event with the second click.</li>
  </ul>
